  "system": {
    "identifier": "witch-hunter",
    "description": "<p>You spin your weapon and reel back to deliver a deadly swing that would dismantle apart any foe. Make a melee taijutsu attack against a creature in range, dealing [Weapons damage] + 5d6. If the target of your attack has cast a Ninjutsu or Genjutsu since the end of your last turn, this attack gains a rank of Mastery.</p>\n<p>On a hit, if the target is concentrating on a Ninjutsu or Genjutsu they immediately lose concentration of it if it was cast at a rank lower than the rank this jutsu was cast at.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: The affected creature makes a Constitution saving throw gaining 1 rank of Sealed for every jutsu they were concentrating on when this jutsu was cast.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For every rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the cost by 3 and the damage by 1d6.</p>",
